A hospital admission

The `Front desk` registers the patient in the `Patient record`, with the label
`register`. A `Nurse` reads the `Patient record` with the label `read`, and
asks the `Lab` for tests with the label `order tests`. The `Lab` writes to the
`Patient record`, with the label `results`.
---
Front desk -> Patient record: register
Nurse -> Patient record: read
Nurse -> Lab: order tests
Lab -> Patient record: results
